{
  "_doc": {
    "about": "Typing not yet saved, undo, and the end of an edit, over the todos Firestore holds. Run by shared/src/todos/typing.spec.ts and Android :core TodoTypingFixturesTest.",
    "todos": "Every todo here, in and out, is `base` with the listed fields replaced. Times are epoch milliseconds; snoozeUntil is local YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss read in `zone`.",
    "typing": "withTyping(stored, typing, now): `stored` as Firestore last gave it, `typing` the unsaved text by id; `out` the todos shown and saved. Only the text edit is laid over a newer stored copy.",
    "undo": "undoneTodo(before, current, now): `before` the todo before the action, `current` the live one now (null once deleted); `out` what the undo writes.",
    "ended": "todoEditEnded(todo, startText, now): `todo` as editing it ends (its typing laid over), `startText` its text when editing began (null for a todo new in this edit); `out` what the end writes. Only changed text stamps modifiedAt, once, as editing ends."
  },
